    "text": "The correct order of bond orders of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is"
